<title>INDIA: India RBI says clearing operations on despite stir.</title>
<headline>India RBI says clearing operations on despite stir.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) will conduct inter-bank clearing operations on Monday despite a strike by a section of its staff, an official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The RBI will put through transactions,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
